 | Priorities | ACMP (tightest budget, `T-BUDGET-ACMP-RESP`) > AECP solicited + originator commands > notification bursts > ADP periodic |
 | Frame-atomic | grant holds sof→eof ([F02.4](02_interfaces.md#fig-02-txwave)); no preemption |
-| Withdrawal | an originated exchange cancelled before the serializer accepts its frame leaves the originator lane and the arbiter's pre-start abort one clock after the originator takes the cancellation (a registered mask, in the clock its registered release reaches the slot pool); a frame accepted in the cancelling clock itself is sent, and its slot is freed after its last byte |
